+## Recent releases
+
+### v1.3.1 — current stable (October 28, 2026)
+
+- **PR follow-through**: the card keeps driving its PR to merge (red checks and review threads go to the QA fixer; the merge stays human)
+- **Goal mode**: a command and its exit code decide when a task is done
+- **Needs you**: desktop, ntfy or Telegram notice when a task waits; approve a plan from Telegram
+- **OpenTelemetry GenAI traces** for every provider
+- **Best-of-N**: one task built 2 to 4 ways, ranked on numbers, you keep one
+- **Automations**: a labelled issue, a red CI or a schedule creates a draft card
+- **ACP agents**, Gemini CLI first
+- **OS sandbox** (bubblewrap, Seatbelt) around agent commands
+- **MCP 2026-07-28**: tasks and MCP Apps in the task panel
+- **Repo bench**: finished cards replayed by every engine, judged by hidden tests
+- **Windows apps** (WPF, WinForms, WinUI) verified through UI Automation
+- **Honest effort**: each provider gets the effort on its own scale, and the picker shows what is sent
+- Hardening lots M1 to M10 (no command built from the UI, no stored secret in the renderer, checked IPC boundary, CI that builds what ships, dead code removed)
+- ⚠️ **Breaking**: the Continuous AI daemon is removed; automations replace it
+
+### v1.3.0 — October 20, 2026
+
+pi (pi.dev) as harness and provider; invisible provenance characters stripped from every file an agent writes; CI names the failing test.
+
+Full notes: [CHANGELOG](https://github.com/krovomi/WorkPilot-AI/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md).
+
